== text

First, I need to understand what lossless compression means in this context. Lossless compression means that the original data can be perfectly reconstructed from the compressed data. So, for a language model, this would mean that the compressed weights can be decompressed back to the original weights without any loss of information.

Now, the key insight is that the weights are not random. So, there's some structure or pattern in the weights
